<title>CONGO: Stray shots hit French base in Congo, no injuries.</title>
<headline>Stray shots hit French base in Congo, no injuries.</headline>
<dateline>BRAZZAVILLE 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stray small arms fire hit a French base near the airport in the capital of Congo, but there was no immediate word of casualties.</p>
<p>A Reuters correspondent saw the shots hit a wall at the Aviation Club, only 20 metres away from where several hundred civilians were awaiting evacuation.</p>
